1
00:00:21,380 --> 00:00:23,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her smile, her kindness, her kiss♪</font></font>

2
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her presumptions♪</font></font>

3
00:00:27,740 --> 00:00:30,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She was in love, she was tired, she walked away♪</font></font>

4
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Only tears remained♪</font></font>

5
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't hold on, can't forget♪</font></font>

6
00:00:36,340 --> 00:00:39,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't let go of her all-or-nothing love♪</font></font>

7
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:44,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪</font></font>

8
00:00:44,340 --> 00:00:47,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪</font></font>

9
00:00:48,060 --> 00:00:53,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

10
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:57,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The light's still on, but you're already far away♪</font></font>

11
00:00:57,780 --> 00:01:01,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The words reach my lips, but I can't get them out♪</font></font>

12
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:06,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl♪</font></font>

13
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:10,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪My voice echoes, but no one answers♪</font></font>

14
00:01:11,100 --> 00:01:14,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is this really how it ends for us?♪</font></font>

15
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:33,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[You don't have to be perfect tobe worthy of Love]</font></font>

16
00:01:34,020 --> 00:01:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[The Early Spring]</font></font>

17
00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Adapted from The Early Spring on jjwxc.net, Author: Gu Niang Bie Ku]</font></font>

18
00:01:48,510 --> 00:01:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that him?</font></font>

19
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's him.</font></font>

20
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've seen his picture.</font></font>

21
00:01:53,950 --> 00:01:55,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He sure looks decent.</font></font>

22
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:55,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's him.</font></font>

23
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:57,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyone who bullies our daughter is no better than a dog.</font></font>

24
00:01:57,590 --> 00:01:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going to have a word with him.</font></font>

25
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:00,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come back.</font></font>

26
00:02:00,870 --> 00:02:01,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

27
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing?</font></font>

28
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:04,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao isn't back yet.</font></font>

29
00:02:04,710 --> 00:02:05,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're not young anymore.</font></font>

30
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Trying to pick a fight with him?</font></font>

31
00:02:07,640 --> 00:02:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly.</font></font>

32
00:02:08,560 --> 00:02:09,910
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Doesn't he get under your skin?</font></font>

33
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Keep it down.</font></font>

34
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why should we serve him?</font></font>

35
00:02:13,190 --> 00:02:14,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why feed him?</font></font>

36
00:02:14,630 --> 00:02:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're treating him like our son-in-law now.</font></font>

37
00:02:15,560 --> 00:02:17,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't serve him.</font></font>

38
00:02:17,470 --> 00:02:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't even bring out the dishes he ordered.</font></font>

39
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:21,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He helped himself to the peanuts</font></font>

40
00:02:21,950 --> 00:02:24,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the drinks.</font></font>

41
00:02:24,110 --> 00:02:25,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Was I supposed to stop him from drinking?</font></font>

42
00:02:25,830 --> 00:02:26,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Jeez.</font></font>

43
00:02:26,830 --> 00:02:28,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Boss, bill, please.</font></font>

44
00:02:28,350 --> 00:02:29,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Coming.</font></font>

45
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:30,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here you go.</font></font>

46
00:02:31,630 --> 00:02:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That'll be 150.</font></font>

47
00:02:36,550 --> 00:02:37,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao,</font></font>

48
00:02:37,550 --> 00:02:38,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">where are you?</font></font>

49
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry home.</font></font>

50
00:02:40,280 --> 00:02:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

51
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:42,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright. See you.</font></font>

52
00:02:57,040 --> 00:02:58,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're closed.</font></font>

53
00:03:01,830 --> 00:03:02,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Shang,</font></font>

54
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's only eight.</font></font>

55
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The sign says you close at ten.</font></font>

56
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't call me that.</font></font>

57
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:09,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I own this place.</font></font>

58
00:03:09,720 --> 00:03:11,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll close whenever I want.</font></font>

59
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:12,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Shang,</font></font>

60
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm waiting for someone.</font></font>

61
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I told you not to call me that.</font></font>

62
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:17,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Listen.</font></font>

63
00:03:18,110 --> 00:03:19,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop wasting your time.</font></font>

64
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:22,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The person you're waiting for is not coming today.</font></font>

65
00:03:22,760 --> 00:03:23,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about this?</font></font>

66
00:03:24,110 --> 00:03:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You and Mrs. Shang go upstairs first.</font></font>

67
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:26,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll mind the shop.</font></font>

68
00:03:26,760 --> 00:03:27,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not leaving</font></font>

69
00:03:27,630 --> 00:03:28,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">until Tao comes back.</font></font>

70
00:03:28,720 --> 00:03:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who says you can call her "Tao"?</font></font>

71
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:40,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Episode 23]
[Luke Is My Dog Too]</font></font>

72
00:03:42,830 --> 00:03:44,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who says you can call her "Tao"?</font></font>

73
00:03:53,670 --> 00:03:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're back.</font></font>

74
00:03:56,070 --> 00:03:56,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad,</font></font>

75
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll close up tonight.</font></font>

76
00:03:58,480 --> 00:03:59,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You two go upstairs.</font></font>

77
00:04:00,390 --> 00:04:01,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry.</font></font>

78
00:04:10,040 --> 00:04:10,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">In that case,</font></font>

79
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">take care of yourself.</font></font>

80
00:04:45,550 --> 00:04:46,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Luan,</font></font>

81
00:04:46,990 --> 00:04:48,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">our tavern is tiny.</font></font>

82
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:50,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why don't you grab a drink somewhere else?</font></font>

83
00:04:51,990 --> 00:04:53,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's talk somewhere else.</font></font>

84
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No need.</font></font>

85
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want to discuss work, come to the office.</font></font>

86
00:04:59,840 --> 00:05:00,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's nothing to talk about</font></font>

87
00:05:01,670 --> 00:05:02,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">here.</font></font>

88
00:05:07,080 --> 00:05:08,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've always held a grudge against me.</font></font>

89
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:14,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How could I?</font></font>

90
00:05:14,190 --> 00:05:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're</font></font>

91
00:05:16,190 --> 00:05:17,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">such a big shot.</font></font>

92
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would I hold a grudge?</font></font>

93
00:05:26,960 --> 00:05:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao.</font></font>

94
00:05:29,480 --> 00:05:30,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can you please talk to me nicely?</font></font>

95
00:05:31,840 --> 00:05:33,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's not that I can't.</font></font>

96
00:05:36,160 --> 00:05:38,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just don't have anything to say to you.</font></font>

97
00:06:08,040 --> 00:06:10,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've received 10,000 yuan via Alipay.</font></font>

98
00:06:15,520 --> 00:06:16,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

99
00:06:19,110 --> 00:06:20,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's only one plate of peanuts and one bottle of soda.</font></font>

100
00:06:20,670 --> 00:06:21,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you pay ten thousand?</font></font>

101
00:06:22,040 --> 00:06:22,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you're that rich,</font></font>

102
00:06:22,670 --> 00:06:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why don't you just buy this tavern?</font></font>

103
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would you sell it?</font></font>

104
00:06:29,190 --> 00:06:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Everything has a price in your eyes.</font></font>

105
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:32,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why did you sell</font></font>

106
00:06:32,550 --> 00:06:34,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">the bags and gifts I gave you?</font></font>

107
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If it's because</font></font>

108
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I sold your gifts</font></font>

109
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:43,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and left without saying goodbye,</font></font>

110
00:06:43,350 --> 00:06:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll apologize.</font></font>

111
00:06:45,960 --> 00:06:47,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I haven't spent a single cent from selling those bags.</font></font>

112
00:06:47,920 --> 00:06:48,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you want it back,</font></font>

113
00:06:48,600 --> 00:06:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">give me your account number.</font></font>

114
00:06:50,790 --> 00:06:51,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll transfer the money back.</font></font>

115
00:06:52,080 --> 00:06:53,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you don't,</font></font>

116
00:06:53,400 --> 00:06:54,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll donate it when I get the chance.</font></font>

117
00:06:54,920 --> 00:06:55,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How does that sound?</font></font>

118
00:06:59,790 --> 00:07:00,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Keep it.</font></font>

119
00:07:05,550 --> 00:07:06,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

120
00:07:08,110 --> 00:07:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll keep it.</font></font>

121
00:07:10,960 --> 00:07:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now we're even.</font></font>

122
00:07:15,230 --> 00:07:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao.</font></font>

123
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll come back tomorrow.</font></font>

124
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:24,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What exactly do you want?</font></font>

125
00:07:26,350 --> 00:07:27,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You want to tell my parents about what happened between us,</font></font>

126
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:29,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">don't you?</font></font>

127
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to.</font></font>

128
00:07:31,040 --> 00:07:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll tell them right now.</font></font>

129
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I behaved badly.</font></font>

130
00:07:35,110 --> 00:07:36,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I got involved with you</font></font>

131
00:07:36,310 --> 00:07:37,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because I wanted to climb the ladder.</font></font>

132
00:07:42,280 --> 00:07:43,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've never thought of our relationship</font></font>

133
00:07:43,230 --> 00:07:44,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that way.</font></font>

134
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao,</font></font>

135
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:49,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I truly loved you during those six years.</font></font>

136
00:07:53,870 --> 00:07:54,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That doesn't matter anymore.</font></font>

137
00:07:57,840 --> 00:07:59,350
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We're over.</font></font>

138
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian,</font></font>

139
00:08:13,790 --> 00:08:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm really tired.</font></font>

140
00:08:19,110 --> 00:08:19,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I've barely slept for two days</font></font>

141
00:08:19,990 --> 00:08:21,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because of this summit.</font></font>

142
00:08:25,310 --> 00:08:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I drive you home?</font></font>

143
00:08:27,720 --> 00:08:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you're exhausted,</font></font>

144
00:08:29,110 --> 00:08:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">driving is dangerous.</font></font>

145
00:08:38,420 --> 00:08:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Old Couple's Tavern]</font></font>

146
00:08:54,830 --> 00:08:56,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Follow the GPS.</font></font>

147
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Today's high in Harbin is minus thirteen degrees.</font></font>

148
00:09:14,880 --> 00:09:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The low is minus twenty-two degrees.</font></font>

149
00:09:17,040 --> 00:09:17,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's bitterly cold</font></font>

150
00:09:17,880 --> 00:09:18,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and humid.</font></font>

151
00:09:18,920 --> 00:09:20,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Bundle up</font></font>

152
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to keep from getting sick.</font></font>

153
00:09:27,220 --> 00:09:30,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One look is all it takes to find the right person♪</font></font>

154
00:09:30,700 --> 00:09:33,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love♪</font></font>

155
00:09:34,300 --> 00:09:38,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whatever remains will be the proof♪</font></font>

156
00:09:41,500 --> 00:09:44,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If it never crosses your mind♪</font></font>

157
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:48,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The tide as I turn back♪</font></font>

158
00:09:48,860 --> 00:09:52,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is just formless attraction♪</font></font>

159
00:09:54,780 --> 00:09:59,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your silhouette is closing in♪</font></font>

160
00:10:01,980 --> 00:10:07,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your breathing grows clear♪</font></font>

161
00:10:08,940 --> 00:10:13,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Too many distractions in this world♪</font></font>

162
00:10:13,420 --> 00:10:17,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I would rather forget myself♪</font></font>

163
00:10:17,780 --> 00:10:21,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Just this moment♪</font></font>

164
00:11:10,040 --> 00:11:11,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm home.</font></font>

165
00:11:11,950 --> 00:11:13,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll come get it from you tomorrow.</font></font>

166
00:11:14,470 --> 00:11:15,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No need to pick me up.</font></font>

167
00:11:15,670 --> 00:11:16,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

168
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:18,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See you tomorrow.</font></font>

169
00:11:44,040 --> 00:11:45,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How are you getting back?</font></font>

170
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:47,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's okay.</font></font>

171
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:49,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can get back by myself.</font></font>

172
00:11:51,470 --> 00:11:52,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thanks.</font></font>

173
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:06,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Lumi]</font></font>

174
00:13:06,590 --> 00:13:09,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Luan seems to have taken quite a blow.</font></font>

175
00:13:09,430 --> 00:13:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He suddenly disappeared.</font></font>

176
00:13:11,640 --> 00:13:13,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you two together?</font></font>

177
00:14:19,590 --> 00:14:20,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian,</font></font>

178
00:14:20,470 --> 00:14:21,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">have you lost your mind?</font></font>

179
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you doing out here?</font></font>

180
00:14:25,470 --> 00:14:26,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's freezing.</font></font>

181
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:28,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought I'd have a drink</font></font>

182
00:14:29,550 --> 00:14:30,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to warm up.</font></font>

183
00:14:31,920 --> 00:14:33,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you trying to freeze to death?</font></font>

184
00:14:33,550 --> 00:14:35,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you think I'd take responsibility if something happened to you?</font></font>

185
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Would you?</font></font>

186
00:14:38,710 --> 00:14:39,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

187
00:14:52,120 --> 00:14:53,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Do you have a boyfriend now?</font></font>

188
00:14:54,190 --> 00:14:55,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What are you talking about?</font></font>

189
00:14:59,830 --> 00:15:01,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I heard your assistant call that guy brother-in-law.</font></font>

190
00:15:04,240 --> 00:15:05,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's not my boyfriend.</font></font>

191
00:15:06,830 --> 00:15:07,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's my fiancé.</font></font>

192
00:15:25,550 --> 00:15:26,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is Luke still alive?</font></font>

193
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:28,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke's still young.</font></font>

194
00:15:28,520 --> 00:15:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why wouldn't he be?</font></font>

195
00:15:29,830 --> 00:15:30,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is he at home?</font></font>

196
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

197
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,060
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see him.</font></font>

198
00:15:35,060 --> 00:15:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Still can't define♪</font></font>

199
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want Luke to see you.</font></font>

200
00:15:39,640 --> 00:15:40,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He'd be heartbroken.</font></font>

201
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:46,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even Luke misses me.</font></font>

202
00:15:47,920 --> 00:15:48,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're worse than a dog.</font></font>

203
00:15:48,660 --> 00:15:52,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That you only see clearly up close...♪</font></font>

204
00:15:52,470 --> 00:15:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

205
00:15:55,670 --> 00:15:57,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've been tangled up for so many years.</font></font>

206
00:15:57,830 --> 00:15:59,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm exhausted.</font></font>

207
00:16:00,920 --> 00:16:02,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Now,</font></font>

208
00:16:02,880 --> 00:16:04,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just want to live my own life,</font></font>

209
00:16:05,430 --> 00:16:06,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">take care of my family,</font></font>

210
00:16:07,120 --> 00:16:09,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and put my life back in order.</font></font>

211
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:12,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't want anything else.</font></font>

212
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you have to know</font></font>

213
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">why I left without saying goodbye,</font></font>

214
00:16:17,880 --> 00:16:19,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">it's because I knew</font></font>

215
00:16:19,070 --> 00:16:20,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if I'd said goodbye,</font></font>

216
00:16:20,470 --> 00:16:22,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you would've said a lot of hurtful things.</font></font>

217
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:24,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd had enough of that.</font></font>

218
00:16:34,310 --> 00:16:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Finished?</font></font>

219
00:16:36,310 --> 00:16:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

220
00:16:38,640 --> 00:16:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Then let me say a few things.</font></font>

221
00:16:42,590 --> 00:16:43,310
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead.</font></font>

222
00:16:43,790 --> 00:16:45,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There's something</font></font>

223
00:16:45,040 --> 00:16:46,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I think you deserve to hear from me.</font></font>

224
00:16:47,830 --> 00:16:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Back when you were up for the Specialist title,</font></font>

225
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I gave you</font></font>

226
00:16:51,880 --> 00:16:52,790
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a very high score.</font></font>

227
00:16:53,550 --> 00:16:55,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I only found out afterward that Song Ying had been added as your competitor.</font></font>

228
00:16:57,080 --> 00:16:58,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You always told me to be fair.</font></font>

229
00:16:59,430 --> 00:17:00,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was.</font></font>

230
00:17:01,310 --> 00:17:03,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My score reflected how I saw you.</font></font>

231
00:17:04,080 --> 00:17:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you think you weren't good enough</font></font>

232
00:17:06,670 --> 00:17:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when you first joined Lime,</font></font>

233
00:17:08,710 --> 00:17:09,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that you lacked confidence,</font></font>

234
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:12,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">or that I looked down on you even when you left,</font></font>

235
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">then let me make one thing clear.</font></font>

236
00:17:15,510 --> 00:17:17,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you first joined, you weren't very good.</font></font>

237
00:17:18,560 --> 00:17:19,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But by the time you left,</font></font>

238
00:17:21,360 --> 00:17:22,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you were the best employee I'd ever trained.</font></font>

239
00:17:25,670 --> 00:17:27,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It was snowing that day too.</font></font>

240
00:17:28,080 --> 00:17:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You walked out of my place.</font></font>

241
00:17:30,750 --> 00:17:32,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You made Luke choose between you and me.</font></font>

242
00:17:36,510 --> 00:17:38,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It felt like getting divorced.</font></font>

243
00:17:40,230 --> 00:17:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At least people negotiate during a divorce.</font></font>

244
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:42,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But you?</font></font>

245
00:17:43,800 --> 00:17:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just walked away.</font></font>

246
00:17:47,800 --> 00:17:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you think you were the only one</font></font>

247
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">who gave your heart over the past six years?</font></font>

248
00:17:51,120 --> 00:17:52,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What about mine?</font></font>

249
00:17:54,270 --> 00:17:55,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Didn't I try?</font></font>

250
00:17:55,980 --> 00:17:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Love is tears, and the more they overflow, the sadder it becomes♪</font></font>

251
00:17:59,540 --> 00:18:03,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Once the rainy season passes, I'll decide who to forget...♪</font></font>

252
00:18:06,710 --> 00:18:07,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

253
00:18:11,840 --> 00:18:13,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm really grateful</font></font>

254
00:18:13,400 --> 00:18:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for everything you've done for me over those years.</font></font>

255
00:18:16,320 --> 00:18:17,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I truly appreciate it.</font></font>

256
00:18:19,320 --> 00:18:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I already wished you well</font></font>

257
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in the last message</font></font>

258
00:18:21,560 --> 00:18:23,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I sent you.</font></font>

259
00:18:28,670 --> 00:18:30,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I always hope everything goes well for you.</font></font>

260
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

261
00:18:38,360 --> 00:18:40,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we still have a long life ahead of us.</font></font>

262
00:18:43,640 --> 00:18:46,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There are so many things worth doing</font></font>

263
00:18:46,320 --> 00:18:48,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and so many people worth loving.</font></font>

264
00:18:55,800 --> 00:18:57,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go back, Luan Nian.</font></font>

265
00:19:00,360 --> 00:19:01,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not leaving.</font></font>

266
00:19:02,750 --> 00:19:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I want to see Luke right now.</font></font>

267
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:08,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke had been with me since the day we brought him home.</font></font>

268
00:19:08,670 --> 00:19:09,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I fed him.</font></font>

269
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:11,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I took him hiking.</font></font>

270
00:19:11,030 --> 00:19:11,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I walked him.</font></font>

271
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:13,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why can't I see him?</font></font>

272
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:15,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Because Luke is my dog.</font></font>

273
00:19:15,560 --> 00:19:16,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your dog's name is Luke.</font></font>

274
00:19:18,320 --> 00:19:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's named after my English name.</font></font>

275
00:19:26,230 --> 00:19:27,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I trained him too.</font></font>

276
00:19:27,270 --> 00:19:28,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why can't I see him?</font></font>

277
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:32,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her smile, her kindness♪</font></font>

278
00:19:32,900 --> 00:19:36,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her kiss, her presumptions♪</font></font>

279
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:39,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She was in love, she was tired♪</font></font>

280
00:19:39,540 --> 00:19:42,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪She walked away, only tears remained♪</font></font>

281
00:19:44,460 --> 00:19:46,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I can't describe, hear, or find♪</font></font>

282
00:19:46,980 --> 00:19:48,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her candor♪</font></font>

283
00:19:50,900 --> 00:19:53,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Silence replaces the words that pass down my judgment♪</font></font>

284
00:19:54,260 --> 00:19:57,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Let our memories be void♪</font></font>

285
00:19:57,900 --> 00:19:59,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her fear, her pain♪</font></font>

286
00:19:59,540 --> 00:20:02,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Her dreams, the way she pulls away♪</font></font>

287
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:05,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I care, I understand♪</font></font>

288
00:20:06,060 --> 00:20:09,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Why are we left in such a mess?♪</font></font>

289
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:13,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Can't hold on, can't forget, can't let go♪</font></font>

290
00:20:13,700 --> 00:20:15,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Of her all-or-nothing love...♪</font></font>

291
00:20:16,670 --> 00:20:17,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao.</font></font>

292
00:20:17,740 --> 00:20:20,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Promises became a burden after all that hesitation♪</font></font>

293
00:20:21,020 --> 00:20:23,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Leaving longing frozen into a winter night♪</font></font>

294
00:20:24,500 --> 00:20:28,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪That girl, my girl...♪</font></font>

295
00:20:28,750 --> 00:20:30,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You just want to see Luke?</font></font>

296
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:33,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The light's still on, but you're already far away...♪</font></font>

297
00:20:33,710 --> 00:20:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

298
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The words reach my lips, but I can't get them out♪</font></font>

299
00:20:38,080 --> 00:20:38,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Okay.</font></font>

300
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke!</font></font>

301
00:21:03,190 --> 00:21:03,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

302
00:21:04,950 --> 00:21:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

303
00:21:09,990 --> 00:21:11,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me take a look at you. There, there.</font></font>

304
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've gotten thinner.</font></font>

305
00:21:15,190 --> 00:21:16,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She doesn't let you eat meat, does she?</font></font>

306
00:21:17,510 --> 00:21:18,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">His stomach is sensitive.</font></font>

307
00:21:19,190 --> 00:21:20,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If he eats too much, he'll throw up.</font></font>

308
00:21:23,230 --> 00:21:25,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Looks like Mr. Xing hasn't been around much.</font></font>

309
00:21:29,800 --> 00:21:31,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You had a point.</font></font>

310
00:21:34,470 --> 00:21:35,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I shouldn't stop you</font></font>

311
00:21:36,230 --> 00:21:37,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from seeing Luke.</font></font>

312
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After all, you raised him.</font></font>

313
00:21:40,880 --> 00:21:42,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you miss him,</font></font>

314
00:21:43,080 --> 00:21:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">just let me know.</font></font>

315
00:21:44,800 --> 00:21:46,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can take him out anytime.</font></font>

316
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:52,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have a few more things to say.</font></font>

317
00:21:55,270 --> 00:21:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go ahead.</font></font>

318
00:21:58,710 --> 00:21:59,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't transfer money to me anymore.</font></font>

319
00:22:01,950 --> 00:22:04,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When you do, it reminds me of</font></font>

320
00:22:05,710 --> 00:22:06,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">how you used to buy me</font></font>

321
00:22:07,080 --> 00:22:08,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">expensive bags.</font></font>

322
00:22:09,840 --> 00:22:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It makes me very, very uncomfortable.</font></font>

323
00:22:14,510 --> 00:22:16,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And don't use any excuses to see my parents.</font></font>

324
00:22:17,800 --> 00:22:19,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I don't like that.</font></font>

325
00:22:21,470 --> 00:22:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

326
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:23,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One more thing.</font></font>

327
00:22:25,190 --> 00:22:26,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Things are fine the way they are now.</font></font>

328
00:22:27,360 --> 00:22:28,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's leave it at that.</font></font>

329
00:22:35,030 --> 00:22:35,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

330
00:22:41,190 --> 00:22:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm going now.</font></font>

331
00:22:42,470 --> 00:22:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll come see you again.</font></font>

332
00:23:33,430 --> 00:23:34,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Luan,</font></font>

333
00:23:34,800 --> 00:23:35,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what brings you here?</font></font>

334
00:23:37,320 --> 00:23:37,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well,</font></font>

335
00:23:37,710 --> 00:23:39,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my boss stepped out.</font></font>

336
00:23:40,600 --> 00:23:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Please have a seat.</font></font>

337
00:23:41,510 --> 00:23:42,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll give her a call.</font></font>

338
00:23:43,120 --> 00:23:43,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No need.</font></font>

339
00:23:44,270 --> 00:23:45,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was just passing by.</font></font>

340
00:23:45,750 --> 00:23:46,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll leave in a minute.</font></font>

341
00:23:47,880 --> 00:23:48,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have a seat, please.</font></font>

342
00:23:50,670 --> 00:23:51,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is this her desk?</font></font>

343
00:23:51,670 --> 00:23:52,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yeah.</font></font>

344
00:24:02,940 --> 00:24:04,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">[Supplier Contacts]</font></font>

345
00:24:07,270 --> 00:24:07,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You like Coffee.</font></font>

346
00:24:08,400 --> 00:24:09,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Iced Americano.</font></font>

347
00:24:09,400 --> 00:24:09,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">One moment, please.</font></font>

348
00:24:09,920 --> 00:24:10,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll go buy one now.</font></font>

349
00:24:11,120 --> 00:24:12,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who trained your staff on client reception?</font></font>

350
00:24:13,470 --> 00:24:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My boss.</font></font>

351
00:24:14,710 --> 00:24:16,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She always says,</font></font>

352
00:24:16,080 --> 00:24:17,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">"Be tactful when you work,</font></font>

353
00:24:17,510 --> 00:24:19,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and never lose your principles."</font></font>

354
00:24:19,750 --> 00:24:20,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anything but sleeping with clients</font></font>

355
00:24:20,440 --> 00:24:21,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is fine.</font></font>

356
00:24:24,510 --> 00:24:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No sleeping with clients? Did she really say that?</font></font>

357
00:24:28,840 --> 00:24:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

358
00:24:30,800 --> 00:24:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was trying to be funny.</font></font>

359
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:34,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What she meant was,</font></font>

360
00:24:34,950 --> 00:24:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">be observant and know what people need.</font></font>

361
00:24:41,190 --> 00:24:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How long have you worked here?</font></font>

362
00:24:42,990 --> 00:24:44,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two years.</font></font>

363
00:24:47,710 --> 00:24:48,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Does your boss</font></font>

364
00:24:48,920 --> 00:24:50,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">go on dates often?</font></font>

365
00:24:53,030 --> 00:24:55,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go on dates?</font></font>

366
00:24:55,840 --> 00:24:57,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not at all.</font></font>

367
00:24:58,270 --> 00:25:00,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We usually don't get off work until ten.</font></font>

368
00:25:00,640 --> 00:25:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She stays even later than we do.</font></font>

369
00:25:02,160 --> 00:25:03,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I'd say no.</font></font>

370
00:25:05,560 --> 00:25:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you sure?</font></font>

371
00:25:07,670 --> 00:25:08,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sure.</font></font>

372
00:25:11,950 --> 00:25:12,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

373
00:25:14,510 --> 00:25:16,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The restroom is outside to your right.</font></font>

374
00:25:16,800 --> 00:25:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll get going.</font></font>

375
00:25:17,640 --> 00:25:18,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll visit again sometime.</font></font>

376
00:25:20,750 --> 00:25:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take care, Mr. Luan.</font></font>

377
00:25:29,360 --> 00:25:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dates?</font></font>

378
00:25:31,230 --> 00:25:33,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why was he asking about that?</font></font>

379
00:25:50,080 --> 00:25:50,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can I ask you something?</font></font>

380
00:25:50,990 --> 00:25:52,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What is it? You seem anxious.</font></font>

381
00:25:52,840 --> 00:25:53,450
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are the advertising budgets</font></font>

382
00:25:53,450 --> 00:25:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for your clients' regional branches</font></font>

383
00:25:55,230 --> 00:25:56,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">handled separately?</font></font>

384
00:25:58,230 --> 00:26:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's usually the case.</font></font>

385
00:26:00,320 --> 00:26:02,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The budget is allocated to each regional office to manage on its own.</font></font>

386
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:05,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A friend of mine</font></font>

387
00:26:05,990 --> 00:26:07,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">runs an ad agency in Harbin.</font></font>

388
00:26:08,120 --> 00:26:09,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Send some budget their way and let them give it a shot.</font></font>

389
00:26:11,270 --> 00:26:12,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let me put it this way.</font></font>

390
00:26:12,920 --> 00:26:13,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Every agency I've introduced to you</font></font>

391
00:26:13,640 --> 00:26:14,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">does honest work.</font></font>

392
00:26:14,990 --> 00:26:16,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They're all solid teams.</font></font>

393
00:26:18,470 --> 00:26:19,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Say no more. I know.</font></font>

394
00:26:20,470 --> 00:26:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's Shang Zhitao, right?</font></font>

395
00:26:28,670 --> 00:26:29,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll give you the contact.</font></font>

396
00:26:29,600 --> 00:26:30,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get in touch with them yourself.</font></font>

397
00:26:30,840 --> 00:26:31,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The contact person is Fu Dong.</font></font>

398
00:26:36,470 --> 00:26:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've been to Harbin</font></font>

399
00:26:37,840 --> 00:26:39,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so many times,</font></font>

400
00:26:40,030 --> 00:26:41,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and still got nowhere.</font></font>

401
00:26:50,600 --> 00:26:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is Shang Zhitao married?</font></font>

402
00:26:53,750 --> 00:26:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of your business.</font></font>

403
00:26:57,430 --> 00:26:58,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">None of my business.</font></font>

404
00:27:02,360 --> 00:27:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's satisfying.</font></font>

405
00:27:03,320 --> 00:27:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Never thought I'd live to see</font></font>

406
00:27:04,120 --> 00:27:05,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">someone like you, who never listens to anyone,</font></font>

407
00:27:05,990 --> 00:27:06,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">finally brought to heel.</font></font>

408
00:27:07,230 --> 00:27:08,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you done?</font></font>

409
00:27:09,560 --> 00:27:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look,</font></font>

410
00:27:10,360 --> 00:27:12,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we're all rooting for you to win her back.</font></font>

411
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:14,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But could you</font></font>

412
00:27:14,230 --> 00:27:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">be a little more straightforward?</font></font>

413
00:27:16,640 --> 00:27:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If you love someone, just say it.</font></font>

414
00:27:19,030 --> 00:27:20,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be sweet.</font></font>

415
00:27:21,080 --> 00:27:22,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Be gentle.</font></font>

416
00:27:22,270 --> 00:27:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See her often.</font></font>

417
00:27:24,030 --> 00:27:25,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Take it one step at a time.</font></font>

418
00:27:25,190 --> 00:27:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't rush it.</font></font>

419
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who is it?</font></font>

420
00:27:55,670 --> 00:27:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you here again?</font></font>

421
00:27:57,360 --> 00:27:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here to see Luke.</font></font>

422
00:27:58,990 --> 00:28:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did you tell me in advance?</font></font>

423
00:28:00,360 --> 00:28:01,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

424
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:02,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

425
00:28:05,120 --> 00:28:05,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look</font></font>

426
00:28:06,120 --> 00:28:06,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what I brought.</font></font>

427
00:28:07,400 --> 00:28:08,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I bought meat.</font></font>

428
00:28:08,560 --> 00:28:10,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make you some meatballs later.</font></font>

429
00:28:10,160 --> 00:28:10,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You need to fatten up.</font></font>

430
00:28:10,950 --> 00:28:11,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Good boy.</font></font>

431
00:28:18,190 --> 00:28:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go, Luke.</font></font>

432
00:28:21,270 --> 00:28:21,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

433
00:28:22,800 --> 00:28:23,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

434
00:28:30,750 --> 00:28:31,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

435
00:28:34,710 --> 00:28:35,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

436
00:28:36,360 --> 00:28:37,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at you drooling.</font></font>

437
00:28:38,320 --> 00:28:39,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll make them for you later.</font></font>

438
00:28:42,640 --> 00:28:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I ran into your neighbor downstairs earlier today.</font></font>

439
00:28:45,120 --> 00:28:46,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">She asked if I was your boyfriend.</font></font>

440
00:28:49,880 --> 00:28:50,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And?</font></font>

441
00:28:52,230 --> 00:28:53,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I said yes.</font></font>

442
00:28:56,030 --> 00:28:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's fine.</font></font>

443
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My reputation is bad anyway.</font></font>

444
00:29:00,800 --> 00:29:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's a relief.</font></font>

445
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:03,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mine isn't great either.</font></font>

446
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Two jerks. Perfect match.</font></font>

447
00:29:08,360 --> 00:29:09,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke,</font></font>

448
00:29:09,750 --> 00:29:11,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">did you hear what he said?</font></font>

449
00:29:12,160 --> 00:29:13,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How about we poison him so he can't talk anymore?</font></font>

450
00:29:50,860 --> 00:29:54,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One look is all it takes to find the right person♪</font></font>

451
00:29:54,260 --> 00:29:56,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪One lifetime is all it takes to commemorate this love♪</font></font>

452
00:29:57,900 --> 00:30:01,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Whatever remains will be the proof♪</font></font>

453
00:30:05,180 --> 00:30:08,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪If it never crosses your mind♪</font></font>

454
00:30:08,740 --> 00:30:12,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪The tide as I turn back♪</font></font>

455
00:30:12,500 --> 00:30:16,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Is just formless attraction♪</font></font>

456
00:30:18,500 --> 00:30:23,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your silhouette is closing in♪</font></font>

457
00:30:25,580 --> 00:30:30,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Your breathing grows clear♪</font></font>

458
00:30:32,620 --> 00:30:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Too many distractions in this world♪</font></font>

459
00:30:37,020 --> 00:30:41,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪I would rather forget myself♪</font></font>

460
00:30:41,460 --> 00:30:45,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Just this moment♪</font></font>

461
00:30:47,400 --> 00:30:48,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao.</font></font>

462
00:30:49,470 --> 00:30:50,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao.</font></font>

463
00:30:51,670 --> 00:30:52,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mom.</font></font>

464
00:30:52,640 --> 00:30:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad.</font></font>

465
00:30:54,030 --> 00:30:55,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you here?</font></font>

466
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">There weren't many customers today.</font></font>

467
00:30:57,920 --> 00:30:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your dad said</font></font>

468
00:30:58,880 --> 00:31:00,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">we'd bring you some food.</font></font>

469
00:31:03,510 --> 00:31:05,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong?</font></font>

470
00:31:06,030 --> 00:31:07,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can't we come?</font></font>

471
00:31:07,230 --> 00:31:08,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Look at this girl.</font></font>

472
00:31:08,030 --> 00:31:08,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well, well.</font></font>

473
00:31:08,950 --> 00:31:09,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly.</font></font>

474
00:31:09,360 --> 00:31:10,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad, Mom.</font></font>

475
00:31:12,120 --> 00:31:13,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Shang, you are here.</font></font>

476
00:31:14,990 --> 00:31:15,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. and Mrs. Shang.</font></font>

477
00:31:16,880 --> 00:31:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You have a guest?</font></font>

478
00:31:20,600 --> 00:31:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What is he doing here?</font></font>

479
00:31:23,030 --> 00:31:24,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Uh, he...</font></font>

480
00:31:25,670 --> 00:31:26,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well.</font></font>

481
00:31:26,920 --> 00:31:28,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke has been sick,</font></font>

482
00:31:28,690 --> 00:31:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so he came to take care of him.</font></font>

483
00:31:31,800 --> 00:31:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's right.</font></font>

484
00:31:32,990 --> 00:31:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tao is busy,</font></font>

485
00:31:34,160 --> 00:31:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so I'm helping look after Luke.</font></font>

486
00:31:39,920 --> 00:31:41,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you cooking?</font></font>

487
00:31:43,430 --> 00:31:44,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Perfect timing.</font></font>

488
00:31:45,030 --> 00:31:46,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's stay and eat together.</font></font>

489
00:31:47,080 --> 00:31:48,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've got guests.</font></font>

490
00:31:48,510 --> 00:31:49,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't just stand there.</font></font>

491
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lend him a hand.</font></font>

492
00:31:51,510 --> 00:31:52,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Help with what?</font></font>

493
00:31:52,710 --> 00:31:53,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm here to eat,</font></font>

494
00:31:53,660 --> 00:31:54,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">not to work.</font></font>

495
00:32:03,230 --> 00:32:03,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well.</font></font>

496
00:32:03,990 --> 00:32:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan...</font></font>

497
00:32:05,470 --> 00:32:06,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

498
00:32:07,360 --> 00:32:08,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Want a drink?</font></font>

499
00:32:09,190 --> 00:32:10,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure. I'll have a drink with you.</font></font>

500
00:32:10,430 --> 00:32:10,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come.</font></font>

501
00:32:14,080 --> 00:32:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The first toast</font></font>

502
00:32:15,800 --> 00:32:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is for you.</font></font>

503
00:32:17,320 --> 00:32:18,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Welcome to Harbin.</font></font>

504
00:32:19,670 --> 00:32:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you, Mr. Shang.</font></font>

505
00:32:27,230 --> 00:32:28,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The second toast.</font></font>

506
00:32:29,120 --> 00:32:30,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you</font></font>

507
00:32:30,560 --> 00:32:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for supporting our tavern last time.</font></font>

508
00:32:33,030 --> 00:32:33,750
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My pleasure.</font></font>

509
00:32:38,840 --> 00:32:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not eating the dishes?</font></font>

510
00:32:40,400 --> 00:32:41,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The third toast.</font></font>

511
00:32:41,990 --> 00:32:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you</font></font>

512
00:32:43,990 --> 00:32:46,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and your friends for looking after her</font></font>

513
00:32:46,080 --> 00:32:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when Tao was all alone in Beijing.</font></font>

514
00:32:50,320 --> 00:32:51,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

515
00:32:53,400 --> 00:32:54,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have a bite.</font></font>

516
00:32:54,430 --> 00:32:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Soak up the alcohol.</font></font>

517
00:32:55,080 --> 00:32:55,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Eat the dishes.</font></font>

518
00:32:55,800 --> 00:32:56,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here.</font></font>

519
00:32:56,230 --> 00:32:57,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Also, thank you</font></font>

520
00:32:57,880 --> 00:32:59,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for taking care of Luke.</font></font>

521
00:33:00,080 --> 00:33:01,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you sure you want to continue?</font></font>

522
00:33:02,670 --> 00:33:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't worry. He's a young man.</font></font>

523
00:33:04,800 --> 00:33:05,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well.</font></font>

524
00:33:08,230 --> 00:33:08,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's enough.</font></font>

525
00:33:09,430 --> 00:33:10,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At least eat something.</font></font>

526
00:33:18,990 --> 00:33:20,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here. Drink it.</font></font>

527
00:33:20,670 --> 00:33:21,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Sure.</font></font>

528
00:33:23,190 --> 00:33:24,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Thank you.</font></font>

529
00:33:24,030 --> 00:33:25,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you hiding something from me?</font></font>

530
00:33:25,400 --> 00:33:26,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You looked after Luke well.</font></font>

531
00:33:27,160 --> 00:33:27,710
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not.</font></font>

532
00:33:27,710 --> 00:33:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wishing Luke good health as he grows up.</font></font>

533
00:33:29,600 --> 00:33:31,190
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're hiding something from your mom.</font></font>

534
00:33:31,190 --> 00:33:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't interrupt.</font></font>

535
00:33:33,670 --> 00:33:34,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Listen to me.</font></font>

536
00:33:35,640 --> 00:33:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

537
00:33:36,320 --> 00:33:36,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You...</font></font>

538
00:33:37,950 --> 00:33:39,270
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you thought this through?</font></font>

539
00:33:39,470 --> 00:33:41,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm always on your side.</font></font>

540
00:33:41,990 --> 00:33:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm really not hiding anything.</font></font>

541
00:33:45,080 --> 00:33:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A spoiled child never turns out well.</font></font>

542
00:33:48,270 --> 00:33:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're definitely hiding something from me.</font></font>

543
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:51,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's the last.</font></font>

544
00:33:51,670 --> 00:33:52,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come on.</font></font>

545
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:53,670
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't let him drink anymore.</font></font>

546
00:33:54,560 --> 00:33:56,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke is closer to you</font></font>

547
00:33:57,080 --> 00:33:58,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">than he is to Tao.</font></font>

548
00:33:58,800 --> 00:33:59,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Drink up.</font></font>

549
00:33:59,510 --> 00:34:00,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop drinking, Dad.</font></font>

550
00:34:00,840 --> 00:34:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- He can drink himself. - Shang.</font></font>

551
00:34:01,840 --> 00:34:02,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Shang, stop it. - Cheers.</font></font>

552
00:34:02,840 --> 00:34:03,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

553
00:34:03,430 --> 00:34:04,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's drunk enough.</font></font>

554
00:34:04,430 --> 00:34:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll finish it.</font></font>

555
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,230
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't drink anymore.</font></font>

556
00:34:10,030 --> 00:34:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lan.</font></font>

557
00:34:10,800 --> 00:34:11,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Lan is not his name.</font></font>

558
00:34:12,240 --> 00:34:13,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's Luan.</font></font>

559
00:34:13,550 --> 00:34:14,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not Lan.</font></font>

560
00:34:14,550 --> 00:34:15,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Luan. - Yes, I'm Luan.</font></font>

561
00:34:16,070 --> 00:34:17,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Shang, let's keep drinking.</font></font>

562
00:34:17,550 --> 00:34:18,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No.</font></font>

563
00:34:18,030 --> 00:34:18,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's drink some more.</font></font>

564
00:34:19,550 --> 00:34:20,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Stop it.</font></font>

565
00:34:20,030 --> 00:34:20,500
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's enough.</font></font>

566
00:34:20,500 --> 00:34:20,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't.</font></font>

567
00:34:20,960 --> 00:34:22,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">My daughter needs to rest.</font></font>

568
00:34:22,430 --> 00:34:23,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Which hotel are you staying at?</font></font>

569
00:34:23,590 --> 00:34:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not drinking anymore?</font></font>

570
00:34:28,590 --> 00:34:29,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where's he staying?</font></font>

571
00:34:29,800 --> 00:34:30,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">How would I know?</font></font>

572
00:34:30,320 --> 00:34:31,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The room next door?</font></font>

573
00:34:31,550 --> 00:34:33,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I asked which hotel.</font></font>

574
00:34:33,070 --> 00:34:34,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm staying at the hotel next door, Mrs. Shang.</font></font>

575
00:34:35,280 --> 00:34:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright. Let's go.</font></font>

576
00:34:36,720 --> 00:34:37,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We'll leave together.</font></font>

577
00:34:38,430 --> 00:34:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Not drinking anymore?</font></font>

578
00:34:39,360 --> 00:34:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you leaving already?</font></font>

579
00:34:40,200 --> 00:34:41,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Easy there.</font></font>

580
00:34:43,360 --> 00:34:43,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Young man.</font></font>

581
00:34:44,110 --> 00:34:45,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Young man, wait.
- That's not the door.</font></font>

582
00:34:45,320 --> 00:34:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That's not the door.</font></font>

583
00:34:46,200 --> 00:34:48,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's a lightweight.</font></font>

584
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:49,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Easy.</font></font>

585
00:34:49,510 --> 00:34:49,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine.</font></font>

586
00:34:49,920 --> 00:34:50,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can walk by myself.</font></font>

587
00:34:50,680 --> 00:34:52,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Don't throw my dad's back out.</font></font>

588
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:52,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Walk by yourself.</font></font>

589
00:34:52,990 --> 00:34:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Go on. - Let him walk.</font></font>

590
00:34:54,630 --> 00:34:55,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Slow down.</font></font>

591
00:34:55,430 --> 00:34:56,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm fine.</font></font>

592
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Easy.</font></font>

593
00:34:58,150 --> 00:34:59,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Can he make it?</font></font>

594
00:34:59,400 --> 00:35:01,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Can he make it? - He's a young man.</font></font>

595
00:35:01,470 --> 00:35:02,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He holds his liquor well.</font></font>

596
00:35:03,150 --> 00:35:04,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's well-mannered when he's drunk.</font></font>

597
00:35:04,720 --> 00:35:05,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You got him</font></font>

598
00:35:05,110 --> 00:35:06,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">completely wasted.</font></font>

599
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:07,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You poured him drink after drink.</font></font>

600
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:08,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He didn't even have a bite to eat.</font></font>

601
00:35:08,430 --> 00:35:10,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The way someone acts when they're drunk says a lot about them.</font></font>

602
00:35:10,200 --> 00:35:11,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">At least this trip wasn't for nothing.</font></font>

603
00:35:13,110 --> 00:35:13,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Alright.</font></font>

604
00:35:13,880 --> 00:35:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go get some rest.</font></font>

605
00:35:15,150 --> 00:35:15,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Go to bed early.</font></font>

606
00:35:17,880 --> 00:35:18,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Luan. - Bye.</font></font>

607
00:35:18,920 --> 00:35:19,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Wait.</font></font>

608
00:35:19,600 --> 00:35:21,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Let's go together.</font></font>

609
00:35:21,030 --> 00:35:21,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Easy now.</font></font>

610
00:35:22,140 --> 00:35:24,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">- Come. - What's the rush?</font></font>

611
00:35:51,590 --> 00:35:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you back?</font></font>

612
00:35:54,510 --> 00:35:55,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The hotel's fully booked.</font></font>

613
00:35:55,590 --> 00:35:56,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Excuse me.</font></font>

614
00:36:00,400 --> 00:36:01,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have nowhere else to stay.</font></font>

615
00:36:10,720 --> 00:36:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Weren't you drunk?</font></font>

616
00:36:13,680 --> 00:36:14,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">That wasn't enough to do it.</font></font>

617
00:36:15,280 --> 00:36:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You were faking.</font></font>

618
00:36:18,280 --> 00:36:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take the guest room.</font></font>

619
00:36:20,240 --> 00:36:21,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did I tell you to undress?</font></font>

620
00:36:21,680 --> 00:36:23,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Did I say yes?</font></font>

621
00:36:25,760 --> 00:36:27,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Knowing how hospitable people in Harbin are,</font></font>

622
00:36:27,840 --> 00:36:29,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you wouldn't leave me out on the street, would you?</font></font>

623
00:36:30,240 --> 00:36:31,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What exactly...</font></font>

624
00:36:31,400 --> 00:36:32,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luan Nian.</font></font>

625
00:36:34,630 --> 00:36:35,510
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What do you want?</font></font>

626
00:36:38,590 --> 00:36:39,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll sleep on the couch if I have to.</font></font>

627
00:36:48,630 --> 00:36:49,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Suit yourself.</font></font>

628
00:38:23,630 --> 00:38:24,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao,</font></font>

629
00:38:26,400 --> 00:38:27,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know you're still awake.</font></font>

630
00:38:28,840 --> 00:38:30,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Just let me say a few things.</font></font>

631
00:38:31,630 --> 00:38:32,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You don't have to answer.</font></font>

632
00:38:37,720 --> 00:38:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">After you left,</font></font>

633
00:38:38,600 --> 00:38:40,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I thought about us a lot.</font></font>

634
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know you put up with a lot</font></font>

635
00:38:46,280 --> 00:38:47,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">in our relationship.</font></font>

636
00:38:49,840 --> 00:38:51,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You endured so much just to be with me,</font></font>

637
00:38:52,070 --> 00:38:53,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">because you loved me.</font></font>

638
00:38:57,550 --> 00:38:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But back then,</font></font>

639
00:39:00,030 --> 00:39:01,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was too arrogant.</font></font>

640
00:39:02,720 --> 00:39:03,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I realized everything too late.</font></font>

641
00:39:05,950 --> 00:39:07,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I didn't treat you well enough.</font></font>

642
00:39:09,990 --> 00:39:11,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But my feelings were real.</font></font>

643
00:39:13,470 --> 00:39:14,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sure you could tell.</font></font>

644
00:39:28,950 --> 00:39:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">When I said I wanted to take care of Luke with you,</font></font>

645
00:39:30,240 --> 00:39:30,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I meant it.</font></font>

646
00:39:32,920 --> 00:39:34,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We've still got a long road ahead.</font></font>

647
00:39:35,550 --> 00:39:36,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll take it one step at a time.</font></font>

648
00:39:43,150 --> 00:39:43,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Shang Zhitao,</font></font>

649
00:39:46,880 --> 00:39:47,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm sorry.</font></font>

650
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:51,590
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">For everything that happened.</font></font>

651
00:40:17,800 --> 00:40:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">The old me always thought</font></font>

652
00:40:20,680 --> 00:40:22,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wasn't good enough.</font></font>

653
00:40:23,630 --> 00:40:25,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even so, I knew I was loved.</font></font>

654
00:40:28,360 --> 00:40:29,550
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">We really did love each other.</font></font>

655
00:40:31,030 --> 00:40:31,950
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But</font></font>

656
00:40:31,950 --> 00:40:33,150
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he was too proud,</font></font>

657
00:40:33,550 --> 00:40:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and I was too insecure.</font></font>

658
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:36,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Neither of us</font></font>

659
00:40:36,920 --> 00:40:38,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">would back down.</font></font>

660
00:40:40,200 --> 00:40:41,030
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

661
00:40:41,760 --> 00:40:43,430
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why is he always like this?</font></font>

662
00:40:44,070 --> 00:40:46,070
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Every time I make up my mind,</font></font>

663
00:40:48,590 --> 00:40:49,630
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he shows up</font></font>

664
00:40:49,920 --> 00:40:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and undoes everything I've worked so hard for.</font></font>

665
00:41:19,990 --> 00:41:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why are you here?</font></font>

666
00:41:21,430 --> 00:41:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I brought Luke breakfast.</font></font>

667
00:41:23,030 --> 00:41:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll check on him</font></font>

668
00:41:23,880 --> 00:41:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before heading to the airport.</font></font>

669
00:41:34,400 --> 00:41:35,110
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Luke.</font></font>

670
00:41:36,030 --> 00:41:36,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come here, Luke.</font></font>

671
00:41:40,400 --> 00:41:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Come, let's not eat bread.</font></font>

672
